{% set local_problem %}
<p>Surface drainage has limits. Splash blocks move water a few feet at best. Extensions trip people and get damaged by lawn mowers. And during heavy storms, surface discharge can't keep up with the volume.</p>

<p>Underground drains solve these problems permanently. They capture water from your downspouts and carry it through buried pipes to a safe discharge point — 20, 30, even 50 feet from your foundation if needed.</p>

<p>For Hazel Green properties with drainage challenges, underground drains are often the most effective solution.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Underground drains include catch basins at each downspout, solid PVC pipe buried underground, proper slope for gravity flow, and a discharge point away from structures.</p>

<p>We assess your property, identify optimal discharge locations, and design a system that uses gravity effectively. The result is complete, invisible water management.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set why_us %}
<p>Underground drainage requires understanding water flow, not just digging trenches. We've installed these systems throughout North Alabama and know how to do them right.</p>

<p>Based just 15 miles away in Huntsville, we stand behind our work and respond quickly if any issues arise.</p>
{% endset %}
